# Frame scoping

Read `.ai/rules/frame-scoping.md` and activate skill `olie-frame-context` when changing tenant boundaries.

- Query/validate/authorize with `frame_id`
- Policies: `ensureModelFrameId` → cross-tenant = 404
- Controllers: `checkFrameId($model)` when fetching manually
- Outside HTTP: `FrameContext::forceFrameById` / `withFrame`
